{"id":"305da02a1b78fc3e","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-theoryextension.md","title":"A DNF theory represents a total extension","display":"thm-theoryextension — A DNF theory represents a total extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-theoryextension","aliases":["27-thm-theoryextension"],"display":"thm-theoryextension — A DNF theory represents a total extension","depends_on":["[[27-df-pattern]]","[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-extension]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.3, theory definition and discussion","source_printed_pages":"519","source_pdf_pages":"543","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-theoryextension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-theoryextension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-theoryextension — A DNF theory represents a total extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.3, theory definition and discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"519"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"543"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\((T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>模式逐项在 F 上为 0，覆盖条件保证总析取在 T 上为 1。这只断言 theory 给出扩张；原书指出反向不成立，故不误写双条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pattern]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)).","display":true}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-570","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-theoryextension|thm-theoryextension — A DNF theory represents a total extension]]"}],"outgoing":["5b4178d75957ed66","0b618255959ff4bc","2080bf803b294b75"]}